    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Rubber tyre with a directional block tread, shoulder siping, moulded sidewall ribs and two coloured balance dots. Tread wraps continuously around the circumference and both sidewalls and the inner bead are modelled. Title corrected: the package is a tyre only, with no alloy rim inside it.",
